This project contains F01/F02 prediction code extracted from Open Athena's pdbthink.
Upstream: https://github.com/Open-Athena/pdbthink
The upstream Apache-2.0 licence is retained in LICENSE.
See data/provenance/extraction.json for source file hashes and extraction details.
The Python namespace pdbthink is retained for compatibility; install this standalone
project in a separate environment from the original pdbthink repository.
Experimental PDB data originate from RCSB PDB; computational source data originate
from the versioned MarinFold exp278 experiment. Their provenance is retained.
